SY_TALK("ixBt6h60JI0",[[0,["Today we have assembled in the area of Vishuddhi."]],[18,["In the Gita, Shri Krishna has described"]],[27,["the area as Kshetra,"]],[31,["and the one who knows the area is called as Kshetragna."]],[40,["Gna, yesterday as I told you, gna or gya, means:"]],[43,["\"The one to know on your central nervous system\"."]],[48,["So the one who is the knower of that area is the Kshetragna."]],[58,["Today we are going to know about the Hamsa Chakra."]],[67,["That is the area of, between the two eyebrows,"]],[82,["[SOUNDS LIKE 'RUKUTIS'], they have called it."]],[88,["This one is placed at the base of the brain,"]],[107,["which is called as Mooldar,"]],[113,["and this part is the complete controller"]],[124,["of the whole of the base of the brain,"]],[126,["again I say, base of the brain."]],[133,["And that is a part of the Visshuddhi still,"]],[141,["which is an extremely important center"]],[146,["as far as the human awareness is concerned,"]],[153,["because these two nadis, Ida and Pingala,"]],[165,["before entering into Agnya and giving, crossing each other,"]],[182,["part of them crosses over this Chakra of Hamsa."]],[201,["So when the ego and superego develop in our brain"]],[215,["and cover our limbic area,"]],[221,["from both the sides the strands"]],[224,["which are coming out of the Visshuddhi sit on them."]],[236,["So they also control these two institutions from outside."]],[251,["For example, it crosses like this,"]],[254,["goes up like that from Hamsa, and then some strands."]],[264,["Then the others go up again and cross like this,"]],[269,["and form ego and superego."]],[277,["So from the back side, on top of them,"]],[282,["these two strands go and sit."]],[289,["You all know that Hamsa Chakra gives you discretion,"]],[297,["but still we do not understand,"]],[299,["what do we mean by discretion?"]],[310,["The first and the foremost important center within us"]],[314,["is the Mooladhara Chakra."]],[323,["If we do not have the proper"]],[328,["discretion about Mooladhara Chakra,"]],[335,["we get into wilderness, I should say,"]],[343,["or we open the doors of hell for ourselves."]],[355,["As you know, that only the Ida Nadi"]],[359,["starts from the Mooladhara."]],[368,["That means, it's the desire,"]],[376,["power of desire within us, starts from Mooladhara."]],[385,["But it's not the mental, which is the Pingala Nadi,"]],[392,["which starts from Mooladhara. It starts higher."]],[402,["So to have a complete understanding about.."]],[409,["The child is crying, please take away the child."]],[412,["Yesterday, again the same thing happened, this is indiscreet."]],[416,["Continuing with the child all the time, yesterday was the same thing."]],[419,["Immediately you should take out the child."]],[423,["In the meeting, if the child is crying, immediately take out the child."]],[427,["There is something wrong with the child, immediately take out the child."]],[434,["Again it's indiscreetion."]],[442,["So one thing one has to know, that"]],[447,["Mooladhara Chakra cannot be controlled"]],[451,["by our mental activity."]],[457,["But if you shift it to the mental activity"]],[465,["then the control over Mooladhara is completely lost."]],[475,["Apart from whatever has happened in the West,"]],[482,["Mooladhara Chakra is all gone"]],[485,["into the mental activity of human beings."]],[492,["It is so much discussed, talked."]],[496,["It is so much described, written down,"]],[501,["so much read, so much put into our heads,"]],[509,["that it has become a mental activity."]],[514,["So, Mooladhara doesn't act"]],[518,["spontaneously as it has to act."]],[522,["That's why there are problems"]],[527,["that people cannot produce children."]],[534,["So many become impotent very early"]],[539,["because it is used not by the power of desire,"]],[552,["but by mental activity - a shift."]],[559,["Now you see the light here, is burning there"]],[563,["because there is oil and there is a wick, it is burning."]],[570,["But instead of this oil, you put just water."]],[574,["Will it burn? It won't."]],[578,["Because water is not going to nourish this light."]],[590,["So, the more mental activity you have,"]],[597,["your Mooladhara gets spoilt and it becomes uncontrollable."]],[608,["But if it is left to your desire,"]],[615,["so it becomes spontaneous."]],[628,["This is a fundamental principle that is missing"]],[632,["in the Western thinking, I think"]],[637,["that whatever is spontaneous,"]],[639,["they leave it to the mental activity."]],[648,["Wherever the mental activity is to be used,"]],[651,["you should use mental activity and wherever"]],[656,["your desire and emotions are to be used,"]],[660,["you must use your desire power."]],[671,["Also, it is spontaneous,"]],[677,["though it should not be an obsession."]],[681,["Any obsession cannot be spontaneous."]],[688,["It's just, at a moment, you have the desire. That's all."]],[695,["But all the time if there sits in your mind,"]],[700,["that means you are using water to have the fire."]],[710,["Same about the Swadisthana Chakra."]],[717,["Swadisthana is for creativity. Anything you can create."]],[722,["You can create a sari."]],[724,["You can create a beautiful design, pattern."]],[727,["You can create a beautiful art of anything,"]],[731,["but as soon as you put it on a mental level, it's finished."]],[741,["Also in the West, too much discussion is about the art."]],[748,["This is not art, that is not art."]],[750,["This should not be like this, that should not be like this."]],[753,["I mean, it's creativity, spontaneous."]],[755,["Whatever the artist wants to produce,"]],[758,["let him produce, and who are you to judge and criticize?"]],[766,["You cannot appreciate anything"]],[767,["unless and until it is brought to the mental level."]],[772,["So now, we have critics,"]],[778,["and the artists are not spontaneous,"]],[781,["they're afraid; they only think:"]],[783,["\"What will the critics say?\""]],[787,["Even when I'm writing the book,"]],[790,["when I give it to some Sahaja Yogis to read, they say:"]],[793,["\"Mother, if You write it like this, then they'll say like this.\""]],[797,["I said: \"Let them say, who cares?\""]],[803,["So then, critics should criticize"]],[808,["and say: \"This is not all right. This is not an art"]],[811,["because this is such, this is such\"."]],[813,["So the artists are finishing, art is finishing."]],[818,["Now what is left are critics."]],[820,["So now they don't know what to do with their profession,"]],[823,["so they are criticizing each other."]],[825,["So we have only critics criticizing each other."]],[829,["But there's no art now. What to criticize?"]],[836,["And art has to be now made into money."]],[842,["So the critics must certify."]],[846,["It's so man-oriented, the whole programming of these critics is,"]],[852,["that it is never an art. You know, they draw one line"]],[855,["and say: \"Now this is art, all right\"."]],[857,["If the critics say that it's art you had better accept,"]],[859,["it is an art. Now, what is so artistic about a line?"]],[865,["Then again mental: \"It's a lonely person standing there\" this, that."]],[870,["It should be spontaneous! Why to describe an art?"]],[880,["So the mental level is so alert"]],[882,["and is all the time trying to see things"]],[886,["according to certain norms."]],[891,["All these norms are created about something"]],[893,["so spontaneous like sex, like art."]],[906,["All bathroom culture is decided by the brain."]],[913,["Nothing is spontaneous. It's such a joke, I tell you!"]],[923,["So people become artificial. Art becomes artificial."]],[933,["Your Mooladhara becomes artificial."]],[937,["Because it's all now man-made."]],[945,["All the spontaneity is lost."]],[950,["If you see any art from any country, just watch."]],[954,["Why must you react to it? Just watch, as Sahaja Yogis."]],[960,["You should just watch"]],[963,["and the whole thing will start flowing through."]],[969,["Now this Greek tragedy of romanticism,"]],[974,["then the romance of Romeo and Juliet,"]],[978,["all is imaginary, is all mental."]],[984,["There's no spontaneity in it."]],[990,["And then you accept, accept only relationships"]],[995,["when there is artificiality"]],[999,["even between husband and wife."]],[1002,["Like the husband must bring a flower every day to the wife,"]],[1006,["show her a flower, as if she's a priest or something."]],[1013,["And the wife must - I don't know"]],[1016,["what they do all artificialities."]],[1021,["And then he must say \"Thank you\" ten times to her,"]],[1026,["and she must say \"Sorry\" to him a hundred times."]],[1033,["I mean they're husband and wife,"]],[1034,["left and right side of a chariot!"]],[1041,["And then the men expect this should happen."]],[1046,["Women expect this should happen."]],[1049,["Men expect the women should be like men,"]],[1053,["and women expect women, men should be like women."]],[1061,["Men are very particular about time, women are not."]],[1066,["So women must be very particular about time,"]],[1068,["otherwise they think she is the worst person"]],[1071,["they have ever known."]],[1075,["The woman is, say, more particular about her kitchen"]],[1079,["or maybe about her dress."]],[1086,["So the man would get angry with her"]],[1088,["because she takes too much time to get ready."]],[1093,["It's mutually so indiscreet"]],[1098,["that the relationship becomes absolutely absurd."]],[1106,["There should be understanding that she is the left side"]],[1109,["and you are the right side,"]],[1112,["and both of you have to act according to your nature."]],[1118,["On the contrary,"]],[1121,["you want to make somebody look so funny,"]],[1125,["because imagine a man becoming a woman"]],[1127,["and a woman becoming a man. You see it's a joke,"]],[1132,["but that's what has happened."]],[1138,["Whatever the men are supposed to do they cannot do"]],[1140,["and whatever women are supposed to do they cannot do."]],[1144,["Whatever the children are supposed to do they do not do."]],[1148,["For example, children in the West will go on asking: \"Why?\""]],[1154,["Who are they to ask \"Why?\" What is their growth?"]],[1157,["What is their intelligence? What is their maturity?"]],[1161,["They cannot be treated like a judge sitting in the court."]],[1167,["They are children!"]],[1172,["But when they come to Sahaja Yoga"]],[1178,["they lose their discretion."]],[1181,["First, before coming to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1184,["the husband and wife quarrel all the time."]],[1191,["Half steps are in the courts and half outside."]],[1198,["After Sahaja Yoga they cling to each other,"]],[1201,["so much like glued together, it's impossible."]],[1206,["So much so that for the wife's sake"]],[1208,["they will leave Sahaja Yoga."]],[1214,["They'll ruin each other like that. They're glued together."]],[1220,["Before Sahaja Yoga they neglect their children, don't bother."]],[1223,["After Sahaja Yoga they're glued to their children."]],[1227,["Then nobody can say a word against the child."]],[1229,["The child can go and hit anyone, you cannot say anything."]],[1236,["They'll ruin the child."]],[1239,["So the discretion is lost completely in relationships,"]],[1243,["whether it is sex, whether it is creativity,"]],[1247,["whether it is family, anything."]],[1259,["That's the part of the Hamsa Chakra."]],[1263,["Then we come to the Nabhi Chakra."]],[1269,["In Nabhi Chakra also we do not understand"]],[1272,["that eating is not such an important thing."]],[1282,["Doesn't matter if you don't eat your food today,"]],[1286,["what does it matter?"]],[1292,["It's very important, you know!"]],[1294,["In Pune we had a Puja,"]],[1300,["and we had Western children sitting there in the Puja,"]],[1304,["and there were Indian children also."]],[1307,["As usual Puja is always late,"]],[1311,["but it was in the evening, Sankrant Puja."]],[1315,["So the children, Western children, got up at eight o'clock,"]],[1319,["whether it was Puja or anything,"]],[1320,["and all marched out for their dinner."]],[1325,["It looked very bad. Indians couldn't understand,"]],[1328,["how can that be?"]],[1335,["But they had to have their dinner at eight."]],[1341,["Supposing they don't eat their food at eight o'clock,"]],[1343,["what will happen, will they die?"]],[1351,["So in a way, we restrict children also"]],[1357,["by our own conditionings,"]],[1361,["and also we allow them to behave in a manner"]],[1370,["that they, as if they are very grown up, matured people."]],[1378,["We are so enamored by our children,"]],[1381,["as if to get children is something great."]],[1383,["Anybody can have children, what's so great about it?"]],[1391,["You have to look after your children. It's all right."]],[1394,["But it doesn't mean that you should all the time"]],[1398,["dote upon them, think about them,"]],[1401,["worry about them, and nobody else."]],[1413,["So, if you have to enter into the limbic area"]],[1418,["which is the Virata's place, which is the,"]],[1421,["I would say, from Visshuddhi to Hamsa"]],[1425,["and then to your limbic area, into the Virata,"]],[1435,["then your interest must expand."]],[1440,["So the other discretion should be that:"]],[1442,["\"Am I only thinking of my child?"]],[1444,["Am I only thinking of my wife?"]],[1448,["Am I only thinking about them,"]],[1450,["or I am worried about others' children also?"]],[1455,["I'm thinking about others' children?\""]],[1462,["I just tell you this because it's such a"]],[1466,["funny type of a concern we have,"]],[1473,["and you destroy your children also, by"]],[1481,["this kind of a indiscreet concern."]],[1489,["Like we had a school in India,"]],[1499,["and the children stayed in Pune. I had My Puja."]],[1505,["I told them: \"Don't bring children\","]],[1507,["because I knew these children are Western children,"]],[1509,["not easy, they can't bear anything."]],[1513,["But the children insisted,"]],[1515,["and the teachers had to bring them."]],[1519,["So the Puja was over as usual, very late,"]],[1522,["about I think eleven o'clock in the night,"]],[1526,["and there was no transport,"]],[1528,["and that's why I said: \"Don't bring them.\""]],[1530,["So they had to get some sort of a truck,"]],[1533,["because these days we were not getting petrol,"]],[1535,["we had been having a very bad time."]],[1538,["So they had to go on the truck."]],[1543,["It reached there by about two o'clock."]],[1547,["Some of the fathers were staying in My house."]],[1553,["Next day they said: \"Mother, our right heart is catching.\""]],[1557,["I said: \"What is that?\""]],[1559,["\"Such cruelty!\""]],[1560,["I said: \"What cruelty?\""]],[1563,["\"The children reached at two o'clock in the school.\" So what?"]],[1568,["Right heart is catching!"]],[1573,["What attachments!"]],[1586,["Your children, if they reach at two o'clock,"]],[1590,["what does it matter?"]],[1592,["Why are you so much concerned about it?"]],[1597,["They are realized souls,"]],[1599,["there is God who is looking after them."]],[1604,["Why are you so much worried about them?"]],[1612,["Leave them alone."]],[1616,["They send them to India School."]],[1621,["Then the mothers are sitting there."]],[1624,["Teachers don't like it. No-one likes it."]],[1628,["They have just gone there, mothers."]],[1635,["No school allows such nonsense."]],[1638,["But in Sahaja Yoga they think they have a right."]],[1640,["What right have they got? Have they paid for the school,"]],[1642,["have they done anything for the school?"]],[1644,["What right have they got to go and sit in the school?"]],[1654,["So the discretion should be, we"]],[1656,["have to bring up our children according to Sahaj culture."]],[1660,["The first of the principles of Sahaja Yoga is fortitude."]],[1670,["Sahaja Yoga is not meant for such dainty darlings."]],[1683,["You have to be soldiers of Sahaja Yoga."]],[1689,["Your children have to be the soldiers of Sahaja Yoga,"]],[1694,["not the dainty darlings. It's not meant for them."]],[1701,["Though they are born realized,"]],[1702,["you are ruining them by making them dainty darlings."]],[1709,["You have to rough it out. You have to make them sturdy."]],[1718,["You have to give them self-respect."]],[1727,["You have to give them dignity and a fortitude, forbearance."]],[1745,["So this left Nabhi, right Nabhi,"]],[1752,["specially the left Nabhi, is a very big problem,"]],[1760,["where the woman has to be a Gruha Lakshmi"]],[1767,["and husband has not to be a Romeo, but a husband."]],[1777,["He has to see how his wife behaves."]],[1782,["Correct her - that is his job, his duty."]],[1786,["He should not shirk it."]],[1797,["Gruha Lakshmi is the woman who should know that"]],[1800,["she has the great responsibility"]],[1803,["of creating a very great society of Sahaja Yoga."]],[1809,["She's not an ordinary woman."]],[1812,["How many women got their realization before?"]],[1819,["But in Sahaja Yoga if you find the ladies,"]],[1821,["you hardly find very few who are really alert."]],[1827,["Most of them are in trance condition."]],[1834,["They don't know anything."]],[1840,["They don't know anything. They don't know much of cooking,"]],[1844,["you ask them anything, they don't know anything."]],[1848,["You talk to them, you feel as if"]],[1855,["they have taken some sort of a drug."]],[1858,["Nothing goes into their heads."]],[1862,["Sometimes one feels, it's better I do it Myself, impossible."]],[1871,["The alertness is gone,"]],[1875,["because alertness that comes"]],[1877,["through your right side is wasted on nonsensical things."]],[1884,["Attention is wasted on nonsensical things, that's why"]],[1890,["the housewives have lost that discretion"]],[1895,["to know that they have to be"]],[1898,["extremely alert and sensible and wise."]],[1910,["They should know each and everything."]],[1917,["It's not so. They just live in the air,"]],[1921,["somewhere hanging, you know."]],[1922,["You don't know what to say to them,"]],[1924,["how to ask for anything."]],[1928,["How to explain anything to them is an impossible situation."]],[1939,["So that alertness has to be there"]],[1944,["in a housewife. It's extremely important."]],[1951,["So we have Fatima at a young age."]],[1955,["She had these two sweet children"]],[1957,["who died in the war in Kabula."]],[1961,["What a brave woman,"]],[1963,["the way she established the Shia system."]],[1971,["Her husband also died,"]],[1975,["and she did all that on her own."]],[1979,["Living behind the purdah, living behind the walls,"]],[1985,["she managed everything."]],[1988,["We have had many such queens in our country."]],[1993,["There was a seventeen-year-old widow,"]],[1997,["who was the daughter-in-law of Shivaji;"]],[2000,["she fought with Aurangzeb and defeated him,"]],[2004,["in our country: Tara Bai. So many of them we had."]],[2012,["But if you do not have the alertness,"]],[2018,["then you cannot be a Gruha Lakshmi,"]],[2021,["you cannot be a good mother, you cannot be a good wife."]],[2032,["There's no slavery in it."]],[2037,["They don't know even what pleases their husbands,"]],[2047,["how to create peace in the family, what to say,"]],[2054,["when to say beautiful things and when to be strict."]],[2063,["All this discretion is not there."]],[2068,["Either they are shrews or they are slaves."]],[2083,["So, Sahaja Yoga is meant for women who are alert,"]],[2089,["who are wise, who know everything about life."]],[2096,["Even they don't know, where are the chakras on the feet."]],[2100,["Look at your Mother. She's a woman. She knows so much."]],[2109,["They don't know anything as to how"]],[2114,["Kundalini passes through these centers,"]],[2119,["what it does, what She is capable of."]],[2123,["But the Kundalini itself is the feminine Power."]],[2126,["She knows each and everything about you, about your child."]],[2137,["Many mothers don't know if the child is taking drugs,"]],[2140,["or is behaving which way."]],[2144,["Except for spoiling or beating, there's nothing in between."]],[2155,["With discretion, the mothers"]],[2161,["can make these special children into something."]],[2170,["That is My vision about them."]],[2174,["But with their indiscretion"]],[2176,["they can ruin these children completely."]],[2185,["This is so important, that our Hamsa should be all right,"]],[2197,["that we should be able to create a beautiful home,"]],[2204,["a peaceful home - not only for our family,"]],[2208,["but for all the other Sahaja Yogis who come to our house."]],[2216,[" I don't know how it has come into the"]],[2223,["brains of Indian women,"]],[2225,["I don't know how,"]],[2228,["but if you have to please them you have to just say:"]],[2231,["\"Sister-in-law, will you cook this for me tomorrow?\""]],[2239,["Or if you say: \"I am coming for dinner or lunch\","]],[2243,["that's the best. They are very much pleased."]],[2246,["\"Oh!\" Just they're thinking:"]],[2249,["\"Oh, what am I going to cook, what does he like?\""]],[2253,["They know about each and every person, what he likes."]],[2258,["It's not slavishness."]],[2262,["If you want to please someone it's not slavishness."]],[2268,["The whole nature is there to please us."]],[2272,["Is it the slavish thing to do?"]],[2283,["But the another side of a woman is she's a Raja Lakshmi,"]],[2293,["and the man who is the king."]],[2298,["The discretion at that point is: are you dignified or not?"]],[2307,["We went to Japan once,"]],[2310,["and they were treating us with great respect,"]],[2316,["even in a village."]],[2318,["First we entered a shop because it was raining,"]],[2321,["so the villagers actually bowed to us."]],[2324,["We didn't understand what's happening."]],[2326,["And they, they gave us presents."]],[2330,["So we asked ultimately, then, the interpreter:"]],[2333,["\"Why are they so humble before us?\""]],[2339,["They said: \"Because you belong to royal family.\""]],[2343,["I said: \"No, we don't belong to royal family.\""]],[2345,["How would they know? No.\""]],[2348,["Because your hair are neat,"]],[2354,["your daughters' hair are neat and shiny."]],[2359,["And you don't go to hairdressers.\" that was it!"]],[2363,["\"Is this a sign, is this a sign of royal family?\""]],[2372,["Yes, that's how the royal family is."]],[2377,["They don't put their head into the hands of somebody else.\""]],[2383,["We were amazed. Imagine the Japanese thinking like that!"]],[2394,["So the discretion is"]],[2399,["that you have to be like a queen"]],[2404,["and the husband has to be like a king."]],[2408,["But not like the king who killed his seven wives,"]],[2413,["but like a king who respects his wife."]],[2419,["If you cannot respect your wife,"]],[2422,["you cannot be a Sahaja Yogi."]],[2425,["Respect is different from being romantically in love."]],[2432,["I think that you don't respect."]],[2440,["To respect your wife is a very important thing in Sahaja Yoga."]],[2446,["For this, I would say the Indians are not so good,"]],[2451,["but also I know some of the Western people"]],[2455,["are also quite funny."]],[2460,["Your dignity is reduced if you cannot respect your wife."]],[2468,["Indians, especially in the North India, not in the South,"]],[2472,["they lack this, to respect their wives."]],[2481,["Also, they lack the discretion that a wife,"]],[2496,["if she is not respected,"]],[2498,["the children will not be respectful to her"]],[2502,["and she is in charge of the children."]],[2510,["But the most indiscreet thing about Nabhi"]],[2514,["is that you don't listen to your Guru."]],[2523,["Hundred times you tell something to Sahaja Yogis,"]],[2527,["but still they will not listen to Me."]],[2535,["Still, they will do as the fashion tells them"]],[2542,["or the norms that they have."]],[2549,["Listening to your Guru, as they say, as if"]],[2558,["it's to obey the God Almighty."]],[2566,["Whatever is said is to be accepted as a great blessing,"]],[2579,["as a great correction and is to be followed,"]],[2587,["not to be just left out as it is."]],[2595,["As you know, your Mother is your Guru"]],[2599,["and She's your Mother. Also She's Mahamaya."]],[2609,["Also She's Adi Shakti. And She's so gentle"]],[2615,["and She's so kind."]],[2619,["She says some things to you to correct you."]],[2627,["So many lectures I've given,"]],[2630,["of telling you what is important."]],[2640,["But you should open your heart and surrender it"]],[2647,["fully to your Guru, then only you'll mature,"]],[2651,["otherwise there is no way out, I'm sorry to say."]],[2655,["I do not like anybody surrendering to Me"]],[2659,["or touching My Feet or falling at Me."]],[2662,["I, I, I don't understand that. I mean,"]],[2665,["I'm not conscious of it, not aware of it."]],[2669,["It makes no difference to Me. Even when you sing My Jai,"]],[2674,["I think that you are singing some Mataji Nirmala Devi's Jai,"]],[2678,["in the third person,"]],[2680,["and sometimes I'm afraid I might say \"Jai\" with you."]],[2685,["When you are singing \"Swagata Agat\""]],[2688,["I always think there's some Mataji Nirmala Devi"]],[2691,["\"Swagat\" song they are singing somebody else."]],[2697,["But for your goodness, for your ascent"]],[2703,["for which you have come here:"]],[2706,["you have not come here just to waste your time,"]],[2710,["but to ascend, and for that it is important"]],[2716,["that whatever I am saying, you have to obey implicitly."]],[2722,["But I never say a thing which will be uncomfortable for you."]],[2728,["I never say: \"You don't take your food\""]],[2732,["or \"Don't drink water\" - nothing of the kind."]],[2739,["But, out of laziness, people just don't do many things;"]],[2746,["or, if not laziness, then just they do not know how"]],[2754,["important it is. Or else they feel nervous."]],[2767,["So the discretion is that Guru is Parabrahma"]],[2777,["any guru, Satguru."]],[2780,["But what about the Parabrahma Itself, which is your Guru?"]],[2786,["I do not say things as hearty as the gurus used to do it."]],[2791,["I mean, if you read about them you'll be shocked."]],[2796,["But whatever I say, every word, you must note,"]],[2800,["is for your benevolence"]],[2802,["and for the benevolence of the whole world."]],[2805,["And, by not obeying Me in that,"]],[2809,["you are not only spoiling your own chances,"]],[2813,["but the chances of the whole world."]],[2819,["So you understand how important it is"]],[2823,[" if you are the disciple, if you are blessed by your Guru."]],[2834,["All these things are written about them,"]],[2837,["but I say not only that you are My disciples,"]],[2841,["but you have got your realization, you are Sahaja Yogis."]],[2849,["You got all the powers. You know each and everything."]],[2854,["You are so special people."]],[2858,["For such people there should not be any difference of opinion,"]],[2864,["because you know the same thing all the time,"]],[2870,["so there cannot be any fight,"]],[2873,["there cannot be any quarrel,"]],[2876,["there cannot be any argument."]],[2880,["But the discretion should be that our Guru is a Mother."]],[2888,["She's very mild. She's very gentle."]],[2893,["She's very kind. I know that."]],[2897,["One day, My brother told Me,"]],[2900,["that: \"What sort of a Guru You are?"]],[2905,["When my guru was teaching me tabla,"]],[2909,["he used to break the tampura on my head,"]],[2914,["and even one percussion I would make wrong,"]],[2923,["he would bring his hammer:"]],[2926,["'And now I'm going to break your nails!'"]],[2933,["I said: \"There's no need to do all this."]],[2936,["Not necessary in Sahaja Yoga,"]],[2940,["because they are self-disciplined.\""]],[2944,["So there has to be the self-disciplination,"]],[2947,["as you can so call it, on the Hamsa Chakra,"]],[2952,["which is the one which knows what is right, what is wrong,"]],[2957,["through which we work it out; whatever is the right"]],[2961,["that's all we do. Otherwise we don't do whatever is wrong."]],[2971,["Then comes the Heart Chakra."]],[2976,["We talk of love. We talk of this. We talk of that."]],[2980,["I mean, so much of talk of love in the West,"]],[2982,["which is never in India."]],[2987,["But there isn't any love."]],[2992,["It is such a love for money, love for possessions,"]],[3003,["but there is no pure love, Nirvaj. There's no love like that."]],[3015,["So the discretion between your family"]],[3023,["and others' family is to be seen. Very clearly,"]],[3030,["you will know that you are doing something wrong."]],[3034,["This is more in India than here, abroad."]],[3040,["That there is no discretion, about the Family"]],[3047,["like people are coming to see me"]],[3051,["so a foreign couple will stay back."]],[3055,["One by one they'll come. All right, couples are all right."]],[3058,["But they'll not bring their uncles, aunties,"]],[3060,["their aunties' parents, their parents, and then"]],[3064,["the grandparents and all that."]],[3065,["Together they will come in one line."]],[3074,["They will always be grouped together."]],[3078,["All of them will be on My head. I have seen."]],[3082,["There's no discretion there,"]],[3087,["that we are individuals as far as Mother is concerned."]],[3090,["She is our Mother. She's our Guru"]],[3092,["and we have to face Her individually,"]],[3095,["not to take all this paraphernalia with us:"]],[3098,["all our relations, my brothers or my sisters or my this and that."]],[3108,["So the discretion as far as the guru is concerned,"]],[3111,[" is an extremely important thing in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3124,["It is.. You want Me to explain to you how"]],[3129,["the gravity acts through Nabhi. No doubt."]],[3139,["But through your Heart Chakra, if you gravitate at people,"]],[3147,["or sort of what you call, the charisma of a person"]],[3150,["or some sort of a nonsense, or the charmingness of a person,"]],[3156,["that means you're attracted towards something"]],[3159,["that is extremely superficial and not"]],[3163,["at something which has gravity in it."]],[3170,["So, the discretion at the Heart"]],[3176,["is to have a relationship which is so detached"]],[3183,["that you nourish everything, every part of your family."]],[3191,["Now somebody's attached to the husband,"]],[3193,["somebody's attached to children,"]],[3194,["somebody's attached to the dogs,"]],[3197,["somebody's attached to the, only to the plants."]],[3203,[" It's very indiscreet."]],[3207,["You should be attached to everything the same, same way."]],[3211,[" I would say that you should be so detached"]],[3214,["that you are attached to everyone equally."]],[3220,["Detachment doesn't mean that you wear dresses scantily."]],[3227,["It doesn't mean that. It's a wrong idea."]],[3234,["Detachment means that you watch everything,"]],[3242,["and you do not get involved with anyone."]],[3247,["You are out of it, and you are seeing everything,"]],[3256,["watching it, you're a witness."]],[3263,["This sort of love if you have for anyone,"]],[3271,["you will be blessed by that personality very much more."]],[3288,["So now the discretion of the Vishuddhi"]],[3291,["is another very important thing."]],[3294,["The other day somebody came, and his right hand was frozen."]],[3299,["I asked him: \"What do you do?\" He says:"]],[3302,["\"I am working as a secretary.\" That lady. So I said:"]],[3313,["\"What do you do?\" She said: \"I type. I type a lot.\""]],[3318,["I said: \"You take to Sahaja Yoga,"]],[3321,["and before typing you just say 'Namaskar' to that"]],[3330,["work that you have to do, just like that,"]],[3332,["and then you start doing the work,"]],[3336,["as if you are not doing it."]],[3340,["You are just doing it, typing,"]],[3341,["you are just typing, that's all. You are not doing it,"]],[3344,["you are not doing anything"]],[3347,["Some people say, \"Mother, You travel so much.\" I never travel."]],[3350,[" I'm sitting or I'm walking. Where do I travel?"]],[3354,["It's the plane that travels, I'm just sitting in the plane."]],[3357,["I never travel like a Superman. I'm sitting very nicely."]],[3366,["Where do I travel? If I start thinking: \"I travel very much,"]],[3371,["I do this work, I do that work\","]],[3375,["somebody would say: \"Mother, you do so much work.\""]],[3377,[" I mean I don't do anything. I tell you, really,"]],[3379,["I don't do anything. Now I'm speaking. All right."]],[3384,["So, just I'm speaking, that's all;"]],[3387,["and this speech also I'm not doing it."]],[3389,["It's just coming out, like a radio."]],[3393,["Would you say that the radio is doing any work?"]],[3399,["It's just a radio."]],[3402,["Actually, I don't do anything whatsoever."]],[3405,["So when I'm not doing anything, why should I feel tired?"]],[3412,["Why should I wear out? So this feeling of:"]],[3418,["\"I am doing this and I am doing that\","]],[3421,["is responsible for creating your problems of ego within you."]],[3430,["So, to use the discretion over this ego,"]],[3433,["to put it down in its proper place,"]],[3436,["are these strands of Ida and Pingala"]],[3440,["sitting on top of them, to bring it down."]],[3450,["And it's like a brake and an accelerator."]],[3458,["So, if somebody has too much of ego"]],[3463,["then the discretion, see, is missing from that person."]],[3472,["He does something, thinks: \"I have done this,"]],[3474,["I have done that\"; as they say, Humpty Dumpty sort."]],[3479,["And then he suddenly finds that's finished."]],[3485,["\"I was very stupid to have such a, such an ego.\""]],[3491,["So, what does he say? \"All right, Mother, You do help me."]],[3494,["You work it out.\" Finished. It's done."]],[3500,["Of course I don't do anything, nor you do anything."]],[3506,["If you just say, \"Mother, please do this for me\", it's done."]],[3512,["If you say, \"Mother, come in my head\","]],[3514,["I come in your head;"]],[3516,["\"Come in my eyes\", I come in your eyes."]],[3519,["Say what you like, I don't do anything at all."]],[3523,["Neither you do anything. It just works!"]],[3528,["Somebody else is doing - all right?"]],[3531,["Need not bother about that. Somebody's doing it,"]],[3536,["but as long as I am not doing it, I am relaxed and"]],[3539,["I am not worried. I am not upset."]],[3543,["So Visshuddhi is a very, very important center,"]],[3547,["and for you Americans, especially, American Sahaja Yogis,"]],[3551,["you have to know that to be in the Visshuddhi"]],[3554,["means you're \"in charge\"."]],[3561,["Not doing anything, but in charge."]],[3568,["Like these two hands are there,"]],[3571,["and you should know that it's the Visshuddhi Chakra"]],[3574,["which controls the two most important chakras,"]],[3577,["are Lalita Chakra and Shri Chakra. Just think about it."]],[3581,["How important is Visshuddhi?"]],[3585,["How important is America? Just think of it."]],[3594,["But nobody's aware of it. America means Las Vegas,"]],[3604,["then all these horrible beaches"]],[3606,["horrible, horrible, horrible!"]],[3609,["Nobody knows what is America is,"]],[3614,["what does it mean to be in America,"]],[3616,["what's our responsibility."]],[3621,["All this comes to you when you allow your"]],[3628,["Kundalini to be up there,"]],[3632,["so you're absolutely detached,"]],[3634,["you're connected with the mains, like this one,"]],[3638,["and the whole work is done by the mains."]],[3640,["You don't have to do anything."]],[3645,["So when you are detached of doing anything,"]],[3652,["of appreciating anything or debasing anything,"]],[3656,["or judging anything, when you are not at all"]],[3662,["doing all this nonsense,"]],[3665,["that means you are absolutely detached"]],[3668,["in the real sense of the word."]],[3673,["So this works up to the Agnya Chakra."]],[3678,["We can say that all these"]],[3686,["discretionary powers are within you,"]],[3692,["they are built in, they are spontaneous,"]],[3696,["and you have to just allow them to grow,"]],[3700,["by meditating, by watching yourself every minute,"]],[3709,["every second, whether are you enjoying yourself or not?"]],[3720,["So the whole of discretion rests on one point:"]],[3731,["how far you are enjoying Sahaja Yoga. What a nice thing!"]],[3739,["Like yesterday, I was meeting every sort of a person,"]],[3745,["and some, some of them felt I was exerting too much Myself."]],[3749,["No, no, no, no, not at all! I was enjoying all of them."]],[3753,["Sahaja Yoga is a very big joker - very big joker."]],[3757,["Say a person comes up to you, you talk to that person."]],[3762,["It's a drama behind every individual"]],[3766,["and you discover what a drama this individual was."]],[3769,["No need to go to any theatre or any film!"]],[3776,["Every personality is a drama. Very enjoyable"]],[3781,["if you just want to see the drama"]],[3784,["and if you just know that, oh, you have to watch the drama!"]],[3788,["You have to see it."]],[3792,["Only painful part is, that as a guru,"]],[3796,["I have to tell them this is not good, that is not good."]],[3799,["That's the only painful thing."]],[3802,["I wish I could have avoided it somehow, but it's not possible."]],[3808,["Because from the darkness to the sunlight you have to come out,"]],[3813,["and you're holding My hand so I have to tell you"]],[3816,["that be careful, it's a very, very small road"]],[3821,["and both the sides you can fall off into Ida and Pingala."]],[3826,["So hold My hand tightly, we have to go further. Further. Further"]],[3835,["Don't look this side, that side. That's all."]],[3838,["And this is what it is when you have discretion"]],[3844,["to put your hand into the hands of your Guru."]],[3848,["Then you don't do anything. You just watch everyone,"]],[3853,["see everyone and only thing you do is to enjoy."]],[3857,["Whether you do it or not is not the point,"]],[3860,["but you are in the state of enjoyment,"]],[3864,["completely in the state of enjoyment."]],[3868,["And that is the state we have to achieve,"]],[3872,["and should become that state as our own being."]],[3887,["Up to Hamsa Chakra you have come"]],[3894,["and the Kundalini is now ready to open,"]],[3898,["very much better, because She knows"]],[3902,["that you are in a state, She knows you now."]],[3914,["She knows you very well,"]],[3917,["and the Kundalini knows that you can now"]],[3922,["pass through Agnya."]],[3926,["Your attention can pass through Agnya"]],[3929,["because you have discretion."]],[3933,["You've cleared out yourself of all these loads and things,"]],[3937,["and you can now pass through this Agnya."]],[3946,["So before realization, those people who have had"]],[3949,["discretion are the best people to rise."]],[3953,["They're solid people."]],[3956,["Or, those who are weak again and again fall and rise,"]],[3961,["fall and rise, fall and rise. They catch again and again."]],[3967,["So the discretion, at that time,"]],[3971,["is to know that you are here for your ascent"]],[3976,["and for nothing else."]],[3978,["And that has to work spontaneously"]],[3981,["only by just finding out Joy and Joy-giving things."]],[3998,["It is not so difficult if you allow the spontaneity to work it,"]],[4007,["but they told Me that: \"Mother, we have to do this,"]],[4012,["we have to do that. What to do? This and that.\""]],[4015,["Just leave it at that point. Just leave it,"]],[4023,["and everything will work out. You are not doing anything."]],[4030,["You are not really doing anything."]],[4032,["It's this all-pervading Power, which is so efficient,"]],[4035,["is doing everything for you."]],[4040,["There is one point which"]],[4042,["I wanted to tell you about the Ashram life."]],[4049,["We have ashrams and ashrams and ashrams everywhere."]],[4067,["Ashram is a small world."]],[4073,["It is a symbol of an ideal world of the enlightened people."]],[4082,["It's not that only those who are having no house:"]],[4087,["\"All right, you have no house? Come along!"]],[4090,["Because you can pay the rent!\""]],[4095,["It's meant for people who are of that quality."]],[4103,["So now in the ashram one has to realize"]],[4107,["that you are under complete observation."]],[4115,["So you have to be alert. Somebody's watching you."]],[4121,["Now you have come in the camera."]],[4126,["You are now in the ashram."]],[4133,["So let's start from the very beginning, as I said,"]],[4137,[" in an ashram, as far as the Mooladhara is concerned."]],[4144,["That part I think most of you have worked out,"]],[4147,["that you should keep an extremely clean atmosphere."]],[4153,["But I have seen some mad people, even in the ashram,"]],[4165,["start behaving in a manner"]],[4169,["that doesn't show that they are Ashramites."]],[4176,["Their behavior is so funny towards sex sometimes"]],[4180,["that I just don't understand."]],[4185,["The relationship between the husband and wife also:"]],[4189,["either they fight with their fists or their legs or feet,"]],[4197,["or otherwise they're absolutely docile"]],[4201,["and given up each other."]],[4208,["It is such a misunderstanding we have,"]],[4217,["without Hamsa Chakra being enlightened,"]],[4223,["that we take to things which were so dangerous for us,"]],[4233,["for our society a long time back, just for granted,"]],[4240,["and we start doing the same thing."]],[4243,["If not to go down to that level,"]],[4245,["but we try to keep company with such people,"]],[4248,["we try to so-called \"help\" them, whatever we try to do"]],[4251,["for them all the time."]],[4254,["We are so indiscreet"]],[4259,["that whatever we try to do for others, anything:"]],[4265,["either there is some sort of a passion"]],[4272,["or a obsession or some sort of a gain or whatever it is,"]],[4279,["then it is indiscreet, absolutely indiscreet."]],[4283,["Because you don't do anything, it just flows,"]],[4287,["goes to everyone."]],[4290,["So, in the ashram the life should be very pure."]],[4293,["Relationship should, should be very pure,"]],[4296,["there should be respect of the elders."]],[4299,["Those who cannot respect their elders"]],[4301,["will have a right Visshuddhi problem, always."]],[4305,["They must know how to respect their elders,"]],[4307,["and a proper respect of the representative of your Guru."]],[4321,["The other chakras are to be seen in the same manner."]],[4327,["In an ashram try to have things which are spontaneous."]],[4336,["Not to have something artificial"]],[4340,["or some things your Guru won't like."]],[4344,["Like, I don't want to see there some sort of funny"]],[4349,["paintings or some sort of, of funny, suggestive,"]],[4357,["stupid kind of an emblem."]],[4361,["In a household that is Sahaj it should be felt by anybody"]],[4367,["who comes in, feel: \"Oh, this is an ashram!\""]],[4371,["clean, neat, tidy."]],[4375,["And also, ashram should be a place of peace"]],[4383,["and happiness and joy."]],[4388,["If somebody comes to that ashram he should feel:"]],[4391,["\"What a place I have found!"]],[4397,["What a nice place it is! I wish I could also come here.\""]],[4403,["It's only your discretion that works it out,"]],[4409,["that whatever you create, whatever you do is for the best."]],[4414,["Now what do I do? You bring some water to Me,"]],[4417,["I just put My hand. I do not vibrate."]],[4420,["I do not do anything to vibrate, or just put My hand."]],[4424,["Finished, it's vibrated."]],[4426,["Now why should I take any credit for it?"]],[4428,["Just vibrated. Finished!"]],[4432,["Do I do anything? Anything else have you seen?"]],[4435,["Nothing. Just put My hand. Finished! It's vibrated."]],[4441,["In the same way,"]],[4443,["when you are doing something you just think that:"]],[4446,["I'm not doing anything. It's just this hand put there."]],[4450,["If there is some red on my hand the water will become red."]],[4454,["So what did I do? Nothing! Nothing."]],[4456,["Now there are vibrations in my hand."]],[4458,["You have put it in the water, it has been vibrated. So what?"]],[4473,["Now in the ashram I have seen people are not alert at all."]],[4480,["Now there's a telephone call comes in."]],[4483,["It gets lost, or there's no communication."]],[4487,["One person doesn't tell another person"]],[4489,["what is the telephone that has come."]],[4492,["But even in the household we have to be careful and alert."]],[4496,["Like you put a paper there"]],[4499,["or some sort of a notebook"]],[4501,["where you should write down today, whose telephones came."]],[4504,["Write it in, one after another."]],[4507,["So when a person sees a telephone call has come,"]],[4512,["that person can telephone back."]],[4514,["It's one of the examples I'm just giving you,"]],[4517,["how you have to be alert about that."]],[4521,["Now if you are cooking"]],[4526,["you should know how many people are going to eat."]],[4529,["There are going to be, say, ten people,"]],[4534,["then the food will be cooked only for two."]],[4537,["But if there are two persons,"]],[4543,["then the food will be cooked for ten people!"]],[4549,["And then the food is thrown out, because after all.."]],[4553,["But this is absolutely absurd!"]],[4558,["I must tell you a story of Mahatma Gandhi."]],[4564,["I was in his ashram. I was quite young at the time,"]],[4567,["but that is on My.. very much recorded."]],[4571,["So he wanted everybody to stay for dinner - lunch."]],[4577,["They said: But we are going there. It's all right,"]],[4580,["you can have your lunch with me;"]],[4581,["and they were having a conference."]],[4582,["All the big johnnies were sitting there."]],[4586,["So he got up, and he had the keys in his"]],[4592,["janeva as they wear, it is said: it is that sacred thread."]],[4596,["Came out, with his key he opened the storeroom and got"]],[4602,["everything taken out, according to the allotment of every person;"]],[4607,[" like one person would get only one \"chataque\","]],[4614,["ounce, for each person. So he stood there."]],[4619,["It was all measured, brought out, for cooking."]],[4625,["So all these people were there. \"Molanar sahib\" said:"]],[4628,["We didn't know, Sir, that you had to do it yourself,"]],[4631,["to stand there with the keys, to take out everything."]],[4636,["We - you have wasted so much your time for us."]],[4639,["He said: What, wasted?"]],[4642,["Yes, for this you had to stand there, and take out the food."]],[4646,["He said: Do you know, this is the blood of my countrymen."]],[4658,["There are so many people starving in this world,"]],[4663,["and if you throw food like that, I assure you,"]],[4669,["one day you will be starving."]],[4674,["You cannot insult food like that, but you have to be alert."]],[4679,["You go to an ashram, I've seen in Australia,"]],[4681,["everywhere it's on, you just go and ask them, all right:"]],[4685,["Have you got ghee with you?"]],[4689,["No."]],[4692,["Then what oil you have?"]],[4695,["They said: \"What oil?\" Only going on like this."]],[4699,["What is this? Where you have, what oil you have got?"]],[4703,["No-one knows what oil they have got."]],[4707,["They don't know. They don't read what oils they have got."]],[4710,["So somebody brings an oil bottle."]],[4713,["I read it: \"Castor oil.\""]],[4719,["\"Castor oil?\" \"Yes, what else?\""]],[4723,["I said: \"Do you know for what castor oil is used?\""]],[4727,["\"No, Mother.\" \"Do you cook in this oil?\" \"I don't know.\""]],[4737,["From where are you coming? Lunatic asylum, or what?"]],[4744,["There is no alertness, is the point."]],[4749,["So, you have to get up at four o'clock, four-thirty."]],[4755,["I don't say you have to do it,"]],[4758,["but discipline yourself because"]],[4760,["that's the time you get the alertness,"]],[4763,["the first shooting of the rays of the sun gives you that."]],[4774,["You'll always see Me early in the morning awake."]],[4777,["Not that I need that, but for your sake I get up."]],[4784,["You can sleep later on, but that time you just get up."]],[4791,["First rays - sun comes much later, the rays come first."]],[4798,["That gives you alertness. Then you have your bath,"]],[4803,["do your Pujas. You are ready."]],[4807,["By six o'clock you are ready and alert."]],[4812,["But the alertness should be about everything."]],[4817,["Now supposing I ask: \"Where did you buy this?\""]],[4824,["This should never be answered for anything."]],[4828,["\"Where do you get this made?\""]],[4832,["I know everything, if you ask Me."]],[4836,["I may not know about this but I will find out"]],[4838,["from where did you get it and I will know."]],[4847,["Alertness about things, what we have,"]],[4851,["what is in the ashram, are we keeping it clean or not,"]],[4855,["or we're lousy people, absolutely lousy,"]],[4862,["don't know anything. Is a big fashion to say:"]],[4866,["\"I don't know.\" I'm not asking absurd question like:"]],[4874,["\"How many hair do you have in your head?\","]],[4878,["or \"How many stars there are?\" A simple thing if I say:"]],[4882,["\"How many cups you have got?\""]],[4889,["Same with the men I have seen."]],[4892,["It's not with the women, but men, also,"]],[4895,["do not have that alertness that they should have."]],[4899,["There's no communication among themselves."]],[4904,["They have more alertness because they are right-sided,"]],[4907,["but they have no alertness about the feelings of others."]],[4914,["Like, there's a husband who is very rude to his wife,"]],[4917,["always insults her."]],[4921,["The alertness of the man should be in the ashram,"]],[4924,["is to shave off his head and also shave off his moustaches,"]],[4928,["and ask him just to go about with the pyjama."]],[4935,["Or even then he misbehaves,"]],[4937,["then get a donkey and make him sit on that."]],[4942,["Even then if he misbehaves, then tell him:"]],[4946,["\"No water available for you, do what you like.\""]],[4952,["Such punishment should be given to a man who misbehaves,"]],[4959,["who has no emotional feelings towards his wife,"]],[4963,["who ill-treats. Or somebody who is very romantic,"]],[4967,["also you should make fun of that person."]],[4970,["This is the alertness of men, is very important to see."]],[4974,["Also they should be alert as to how the money is spent."]],[4978,["You know very well how they have made money"]],[4982,["out of Me in San Diego ashram."]],[4986,["Nobody bothered even to find out, what's happening to this."]],[4990,["They're paying their rent - finished!"]],[4992,["Where are they spending? What are they doing about it?"]],[4996,["Nobody knows about it."]],[4998,["I asked them: \"Did you find out"]],[5000,["where they were sending money?"]],[5001,["Did they send Me the money, My rents, things?\" Nothing!"]],[5004,["\"We don't know, Mother. We didn't see. We didn't bother.\""]],[5009,["There should be alertness as to how much money is going where,"]],[5012,["where it is spent, how much you have got, this thing."]],[5019,["You go to an ashram, you ask them:"]],[5024,["\"Now, how much money you have got?\""]],[5029,["In short, you don't know how much money you have got."]],[5036,["\"No, Mother, You know we went to that place,"]],[5039,["and then we bought twenty tins of fish,"]],[5044,["so all money was exhausted.\" \"But why?"]],[5046,["Why did you buy twenty tins of fish?\""]],[5050,["\"Because the women said: 'You'd better buy twenty fish.'\""]],[5053,["\"How many there are to eat?\""]],[5054,["Like that, they have no idea, no alertness,"]],[5057,["nothing, it's all a mess."]],[5065,["What time people get up, what time they sleep,"]],[5069,["what time, what they do; there is no alertness about it,"]],[5074,["because in Sahaja Yoga you are your own guru."]],[5078,["Everybody's guru. A Great Guru they are!"]],[5089,["You are your own guru, no doubt,"]],[5092,["but you must have that self-discipline."]],[5097,["To be a guru you have to be"]],[5100,["self-disciplined and a determination,"]],[5105,["complete determination to rise higher,"]],[5111,["to ascend by whatever means it is possible,"]],[5116,["whatever is needed for your ascent."]],[5119,["That's, is a sign of a person who will be a guru."]],[5131,["There's no communication. There's a communication gap."]],[5137,["There's no understanding of each other."]],[5140,["There are problems. There's no emotional"]],[5143,["attachment to anyone. That's not an ashram."]],[5152,["Another story I can tell you,"]],[5154,["because I have been in Gandhiji's ashram."]],[5156,["Of course our ashram was nowhere like his."]],[5159,["His ashram was.. You had to get up at four o'clock,"]],[5163,["take your bath with cold water,"]],[5166,["and go for the 'PRATHANA',"]],[5169,["and you would see all the snakes going round you."]],[5172,["And when you are doing your 'PRATHANA' there,"]],[5174,["all the snakes, somebody might be sitting before you,"]],[5177,["doing like that, with you. But most snakes never bit anyone."]],[5183,["You are not supposed to say anything."]],[5185,["And best, this gentleman used to walk so fast,"]],[5187,["this Gandhiji, you see he was hardly he had any weight."]],[5191,["So he used to just jump."]],[5193,["That's how I learnt how to walk fast with him,"]],[5195,["because you had to walk, really run with him."]],[5199,["And then, the food was all boiled, without any salt."]],[5207,["You could use salt if you wanted to,"]],[5210,["and then he would put some oil,"]],[5213,["which you may not like so much. If you wanted,"]],[5216,["you could have oil on top of that."]],[5220,["He said: \"You must make your tongue all right."]],[5222,["Why should your tongue ask for a particular type of a food?\""]],[5227,["He was worse than Zen, I tell you!"]],[5229,["Even Zen tried that very much with his disciples."]],[5233,["He used to make things which were bitter,"]],[5237,["like quinine raised to power a-hundred-and-eight."]],[5242,["Then to compensate it, the sweet was sugar,"]],[5245,["raised to power a-hundred-and-eight,"]],[5250,["so that your tongue is all right."]],[5253,["So the training of the tongue,"]],[5257,["then [INAUDIBLE] what you speak."]],[5260,["What do you say, are you just chatting?"]],[5267,["You are a Sahaja Yogi."]],[5271,["Every word you say is a mantra."]],[5280,["These ashrams are much higher and greater than"]],[5285,["all the ashrams of the world - even Gandhiji's ashram."]],[5292,["Do you know that you are the instruments of God Almighty,"]],[5301,["and when you speak, every word of yours is a mantra?"]],[5306,["Whatever is your desire is the command."]],[5315,["Unless and until you realize this, the alertness about it,"]],[5319,["our ashrams are just like orphanages."]],[5328,["People like a leader to be sweet, sweetie-pie,"]],[5334,["so that they can eat very well. The leader."]],[5338,["Or somebody overly strict comes in. He's another Hitler."]],[5348,["There's no discretion that you have to be strict,"]],[5357,["at the same time you have to be loving, caring, protecting."]],[5369,["Many things can be said in humor."]],[5376,["That doesn't give such a sting to people."]],[5381,["But a Sahaja Yogi should think,"]],[5386,["highly honored that Mother is saying something to him,"]],[5395,["that you have to do this or do that,"]],[5397,["that She's so much bothered about you, about your family,"]],[5401,["about your children, about your ashram."]],[5410,["So that alertness should be also in the"]],[5416,["minds of the men of the ashram: how to behave,"]],[5423,["how to talk, what to say."]],[5430,["You are the mouthpieces of God Almighty."]],[5437,["How can you waste your time chatting?"]],[5447,["So it is to be realized how to behave,"]],[5455,["for a person who is the mouthpiece of God."]],[5462,["You represent Him, actually. How you should dress up,"]],[5470,["how you should walk, how you should sit, how you should eat."]],[5479,["I was surprised that people are drinking beer in the ashram."]],[5488,["I mean, it is non-alcoholic."]],[5490,["But it's beer, made of molasses."]],[5496,["But, anyway, it is beer."]],[5500,["How can you drink that molasses business?"]],[5503,["Have you ever been near any sugar factory?"]],[5507,["The smell of the molasses! You are consuming that!"]],[5518,["So whatever you are eating, whatever you are spending,"]],[5526,["whatever you are talking,"]],[5527,["I mean whatever is the extroversion, whatever is outside,"]],[5531,["must express your inside."]],[5539,["So you have to develop your Hamsa Chakra."]],[5548,["Self-disciplining and introspection:"]],[5552,["\"Why do I do such a thing, I am a Sahaja Yogi?\""]],[5555,["Ask this question every morning,"]],[5558,["and in the evening please note it down:"]],[5561,["\"What did I do for Sahaja Yoga?\""]],[5571,["We have fun. We have music. We have everything,"]],[5579,["but everything should be done in a dignified manner."]],[5586,["Even dancing, I was saying, learn some rhythms."]],[5590,["Otherwise somebody's doing the trot and another is galloping."]],[5598,["That too like horses - looks so odd."]],[5603,["There should be gentleness. There should be"]],[5606,["understanding of the rhythm and rhythmic patterns."]],[5612,["Learn more, how would you dance?"]],[5617,["Practise it. It's all right, in the house."]],[5622,["How the ladies should dance, how should they walk"]],[5628,["because your whole expression"]],[5633,["is the expression of God Almighty."]],[5644,["So how you should be among yourselves,"]],[5652,["how you should talk, when you should get up,"]],[5659,["when you should sleep."]],[5665,["Everything will change if you really become"]],[5670,["aware of the fact that you are representing God Almighty,"]],[5678,["who is the Source of discretion."]],[5686,["In discretion so many things you will learn."]],[5691,["The first is the tolerance. \"It's all right."]],[5699,["We'll work it out. It will work out.\""]],[5702,["You will learn what is love, which is detached."]],[5710,["You will learn what is humor,"]],[5715,["which tickles but does not hurt."]],[5726,["You will learn also what to say in your lectures,"]],[5731,["what to listen to. And of all things,"]],[5738,["you will know how to fulfil the visions of God Almighty."]],[5749,["Now today, I had to tell all these things, of course,"]],[5754,["is a part of Visshuddhi."]],[5758,["But the other part of the Visshuddhi is that"]],[5763,["you are part and parcel of the whole,"]],[5767,["of the Virat and you become the oceans."]],[5770,["So you have to be like oceans. Oceans in every way."]],[5778,["That's how you will realize that this ocean of yours"]],[5786,["has no limits; not only the ocean,"]],[5794,["but the beauty of the ocean and the creativity of the ocean."]],[5799,["Everything is within you which you have to utilize,"]],[5805,["which you have to develop, to manifest."]],[5813,["Because if you are part and parcel of Virat,"]],[5818,["that you are the Virat, then how discreet you should be."]],[5831,["I hope all of you will know that"]],[5843,["your behavior has to be of a level, not superficial,"]],[5853,["not cheapish, not greedy, of course not lusty;"]],[5865,["but dignified, saintly, royal, magnificent,"]],[5872,["beautiful and joy-giving."]],[5877,["May God bless you all."]]]);
